        "created_at": "2022-07-06T17:38:13.665Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Thunderbird\" data-post=\"419\" data-topic=\"29094\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/ba8739/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Thunderbird:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Aaaahhh!!! Card images!!! What the what?!?!?! Girder?! Grimm?! Who are these people?!</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>My guess is that Girder is the gunsmith who made Pride &amp; Prejudice. And perhaps Grimm is the red-cloaked figure in the rulebook.</p>",
