      {
        "id": 246129,
        "name": "",
        "username": "Thunderbird",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/ba8739/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2022-07-08T15:39:17.564Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yeah, I don’t really know what we’re supposed to be seeing with the red figure. I can’t think of a character with space-time warping powers.</p>\n<p>As far as Backdraft Setback, maybe he will be in this set. I don’t remember many differences in his powers during the run of that book, if we even heard about them.</p>\n<p>I just know we’re going to get a Fey-Touched variant eventually. It’s happening right there on his Cause and Effect card.<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/7/78c87b32dc91acbaff364ffdad7107e4b088d4cf.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/78c87b32dc91acbaff364ffdad7107e4b088d4cf\" title=\"Screenshot_20220708-113814-887\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/78c87b32dc91acbaff364ffdad7107e4b088d4cf_2_349x500.jpeg\" alt=\"Screenshot_20220708-113814-887\" data-base62-sha1=\"heuPbni978UNAIEiSWtrNXp7GLd\" width=\"349\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/78c87b32dc91acbaff364ffdad7107e4b088d4cf_2_349x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/78c87b32dc91acbaff364ffdad7107e4b088d4cf_2_523x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/78c87b32dc91acbaff364ffdad7107e4b088d4cf_2_698x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/78c87b32dc91acbaff364ffdad7107e4b088d4cf_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot_20220708-113814-887</span><span class=\"informations\">1045×1497 154 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>",
