        "created_at": "2022-07-08T15:44:18.824Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I’m not certain it exactly fits, but the pink coloring brings Visionary to mind for the powerset. It also appears to be in the Realm of Discord, so that could be adding some extra funky-ness. At the very least, the Aeon man behind the figure appears to be taking some sort of mental damage.</p>",
